Package: discord-bypass
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, nftables | iptables, libnetfilter-queue1, libnfnetlink0, libmnl0, zlib1g
Maintainer: Discord Bypass Team <support@discord-bypass.local>
Description: Linux DPI circumvention tool optimized for Discord
 A high-performance, maintainable Linux application that bypasses
 ISP-level DNS poisoning and SNI-based TLS DPI filtering to restore
 reliable access to Discord desktop, web, gateway, CDN, and voice
 in Türkiye and other filtered regions.
 Includes unified CLI, systemd service, and deep network diagnostics.
